#: scenario8:scenario8_CB9AA495_FFDD_4EFD_A642_3963BBCCBEF7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7b720a9012ff4d50386e24e50f90b0a347aa3470018d64f63a7c6fa0f53106bc
